Motion is visibly less smooth than X / Instagram (media flying in/out, shrinking/growing with the sheet). **Not a shell problem** … WKWebView is the same WebKit as Safari. Three causes, full spec + invariants + measurement plan in the backlog Update log 2026-08-27 "Lounge lightbox smoothness":
